abstract: >
  Analysis code accompanying the study "Human cardiac organoids with coronary-like vasculature promote cardiomyocyte maturation and post-infarct functional recovery".
  This repository contains scripts for bulk RNA-seq, single-cell RNA-seq,
  and Visium HD spatial transcriptomics analyses.

keywords:
  - RNA-seq
  - single-cell RNA-seq
  - spatial transcriptomics

